Description: MQTT driver for Dauerhaft PRO RS-485 actuators
 A Wiren Board MQTT driver for Dauerhaft PRO RS-485 blind and shutter actuators.
 It drives each actuator over the RS-485 bus through wb-mqtt-serial's port/Load
 RPC (so they share the bus with regular Modbus devices), exposes it as an MQTT
 device with Up / Down / Stop controls and a "set address" field, and is
 configured via wb-mqtt-confed.
